// Author: russrimm
// Display name: Dataverse - CRUD Operation Summary
// Description: Daily create, read, update, delete operation counts across Dataverse
// Categories: Power Platform
// Resource types: Dataverse
// Topic: Usage Analytics
// Prerequisites: Power Platform admin diagnostic settings connected to Log Analytics workspace

DataverseActivity
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize Count=count() by Operation, Day=bin(TimeGenerated, 1d)
| order by Day asc
